{"id":"cdiz","name":"加的斯","en":"Cádiz","country":"Spain","lat":36.535,"lng":-6.2975,"dek":"大西洋边的白色古城，守着旧墙与海。","history":"腓尼基人在这里建城，称它为加地尔，意为被墙围绕的城市。它被看作西欧最古老的城市之一，考古发掘出的遗物早于公元前九世纪，还有一座供奉美刻尔的神庙，有人认为庙柱就是赫拉克勒斯之柱传说的来处。\n\n罗马人前206年占领此地，把它当作海军基地，屋大维时代城中骑士众多，繁华仅次于罗马。帝国衰落后贸易地位下降，拜占庭与西哥特人相继而来，古城渐毁。711年起摩尔人统治，城名也由阿拉伯语演变而来，直到阿方索十世将摩尔人逐出。\n\n地理大发现让加的斯复苏，哥伦布的第二和第四次远征从这里出发，珍宝船队以此为母港，也招来德瑞克与英军的袭击。18世纪塞维利亚港淤塞，美洲贸易转至此地，老城的许多建筑在那时留下。拿破仑战争期间，它是少数抵挡住法军的地区，《1812年西班牙宪法》在此公布，1820年市民又为维护这部宪法起义。","culture":"老城是一串狭窄的半岛街巷，胡同通向一个个小广场，新区则是宽阔大街。两者之间隔着时间的落差。18世纪留下的商人与各国商社的宅邸仍在，墙上刷着石灰，海风把颜色吹得发白。\n\n二月狂欢节是城里最热闹的日子，歌声写在歌词里，也写在卡莱塔海滩的记忆中。法雅、阿尔维蒂、卡马隆·德·拉·伊斯拉与帕科·德卢西亚都出自这里，音乐与诗在这座城里一直不是装饰。","pull":"城名来自墙，生活向着海。","sights":[{"name":"加的斯主教座堂","orig":"Catedral de Cádiz","intro":"建在一座被大火焚毁的老教堂旧址上，1776年动工，前后一百多年，风格从巴洛克走到洛可可，收尾时又添了新古典元素。小教厅里存着老大教堂与其他寺院留下的绘画和遗迹，站在教堂前能望见老城与海。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Cadizcathedral.jpg/960px-Cadizcathedral.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8A%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%96%AF%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%BA%A7%E5%A0%82"},{"name":"法雅大剧院","orig":"Teatro Falla","intro":"原剧院1881年焚毁，如今这座从1884年建到1905年，表面铺红砖，是新摩尔式风格。1920年代重修后，为纪念葬于大教堂的作曲家法雅而改名。1980年代一度失修，后经修复重新开放。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Gran_Teatro_Falla.jpg/960px-Gran_Teatro_Falla.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":639},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E9%9B%85%E5%A4%A7%E5%89%A7%E9%99%A2"},{"name":"塔维拉塔","orig":"Torre Tavira","intro":"18世纪时城中有许多瞭望塔，商人靠它们等候归港的船只，塔维拉塔是其中尚存最高的一座。塔内设暗房，借针孔投影把老城全景投在屏幕上，看塔的同时也看见塔所看的方向。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Torre_Tavira%2C_C%C3%A1diz.jpg/960px-Torre_Tavira%2C_C%C3%A1diz.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1382},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%94%E7%BB%B4%E6%8B%89%E5%A1%94"},{"name":"卡莱塔海滩","orig":"Playa de la Caleta","intro":"老城的海滩，夹在圣塞瓦斯蒂安城堡与圣卡塔利娜城堡之间，低潮时约几百米长、几十米宽。狂欢节的歌里唱到它，当地人傍晚来此散步，看潮水退去后露出的礁石。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Playa_de_la_Caleta%2C_C%C3%A1diz%2C_Espa%C3%B1a%2C_2015-12-08%2C_DD_53.JPG/960px-Playa_de_la_Caleta%2C_C%C3%A1diz%2C_Espa%C3%B1a%2C_2015-12-08%2C_DD_53.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":497},"src":null},{"name":"加的斯博物馆","orig":"Museo de Cádiz","intro":"设在旧圣方济各会修道院里，1970年由考古与美术两部分合并而成。馆中有两具腓尼基石棺、罗马皇帝图拉真的雕像，以及苏巴朗、牟利罗与鲁本斯的画作，门外是绿树成荫的米纳广场。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Sala_Zurbar%C3%A1n_del_Museo_de_C%C3%A1diz.jpg/960px-Sala_Zurbar%C3%A1n_del_Museo_de_C%C3%A1diz.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8A%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"}],"foods":[{"name":"炸小鱼","orig":"boquerones","intro":"小鳀鱼裹一层薄面粉下锅深炸，是海边最平常的吃法。老城小酒馆里常以一小碟上桌，配冰啤酒，在卡莱塔海滩附近的巷子里最容易找到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Acciugaio_in_Valle_Maira.jpg/960px-Acciugaio_in_Valle_Maira.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":641},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anchovies_as_food"},{"name":"炸小鱿鱼","orig":"puntillitas","intro":"刚孵化不久的小鱿鱼，整只裹粉炸到酥脆，咬下去有海水的味道。加的斯靠海的市场与酒吧里常见，是配酒的小菜。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Babbo-_Squid_Ink_pasta_with_green_chilis%2C_rock_shrimp_and_guanciale.jpg/960px-Babbo-_Squid_Ink_pasta_with_green_chilis%2C_rock_shrimp_and_guanciale.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Squid_as_food"},{"name":"雪莉酒","orig":"Jerez","intro":"加的斯一带以雪莉酒闻名，酒色从浅到深，风味从干到甜。老城酒馆里以细颈杯盛出，常与炸鱼、腌橄榄同席。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Del_Duque_Amontillado_Sherry.jpg/960px-Del_Duque_Amontillado_Sherry.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1573},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%AA%E5%88%A9%E9%85%92"},{"name":"海鲜饭","orig":"arroz con mariscos","intro":"米与虾、贝同锅煮，汤汁收进米粒，安达卢西亚沿海的家常做法。城里的餐馆多按人份供应，中午吃的人比晚上多。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/01_Paella_Valenciana_original.jpg/960px-01_Paella_Valenciana_original.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paella"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Cadiz_Quay_and_Cathedral_modified.jpg/1280px-Cadiz_Quay_and_Cathedral_modified.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":640},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Carcelcadiz2.JPG/1280px-Carcelcadiz2.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-6.3175626,36.5285553],[-6.3172799,36.5269045],[-6.314188,36.5279849],[-6.3138869,36.5274034],[-6.3113617,36.5278347],[-6.3094984,36.5285087],[-6.3021347,36.5274974],[-6.2967954,36.5287049],[-6.2905679,36.5253884],[-6.2885574,36.5228595],[-6.290028,36.5221695],[-6.2884496,36.522454],[-6.2868676,36.5199186],[-6.2870843,36.5177205],[-6.288367,36.5178859],[-6.2863201,36.5174564],[-6.2847209,36.5154307],[-6.2824574,36.5101883],[-6.2715493,36.4937523],[-6.2599463,36.4730892],[-6.2525368,36.4576927],[-6.2496583,36.4491777],[-6.2473333,36.4487574],[-6.241792,36.4439926],[-6.2369235,36.4476979],[-6.2307029,36.4486079],[-6.2314201,36.4511883],[-6.2297035,36.4523879],[-6.2294138,36.4573584],[-6.2303687,36.4576346],[-6.2251589,36.4639802],[-6.2256044,36.4655496],[-6.227538,36.466466],[-6.227792,36.4632679],[-6.231492,36.462576],[-6.2404865,36.4644139],[-6.